217	7345	tt0469494	There Will Be Blood	Ruthless silver miner, turned oil prospector, Daniel Plainview, moves to oil-rich California. Using his son to project a trustworthy, family-man image, Plainview cons local landowners into selling him their valuable properties for a pittance. However, local preacher Eli Sunday suspects Plainview's motives and intentions, starting a slow-burning feud that threatens both their lives.	2007	158	8.1	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa0RDkAlCec0STeMNAhPaF89q6U.jpg	[-0.0001442548,0.0043537193,0.0018221274,-0.083916664,-0.010268255,0.025870359,0.01523309,-1.1185192e-05,-0.008466338,0.021465074,0.022994405,0.017016947,-0.008251882,-0.023055596,0.13516134,-0.02002239,0.020968236,0.00933765,0.021968488,0.010149702,-0.0247687,-0.012005784,0.04088955,-0.03681829,-0.029711386,-0.006776271,-0.0029623467,0.014457918,0.034045003,-0.0060476875,0.01642315,-0.0067889187,-0.00085826707,0.026126558,0.030884271,-0.019073134,-0.017928697,0.0143315615,-0.0065138093,0.020105653,-0.01588517,0.010990143,0.0038289707,0.00068319583,0.01041912,0.015251322,0.030154217,-0.0076731853,-0.016340422,-0.023691582,-0.031230103,-0.029183647,-0.012253765,-0.17088966,-0.025298765,0.033806004,0.033480775,-0.016915716,-0.014506547,-0.017487902,0.00043721023,0.0073882756,0.01995693,-0.0027317102,-0.033057377,0.008376591,0.011360274,0.001636244,-0.02015783,-0.008347374,-0.010761028,0.00892879,-0.005676264,-0.025198946,0.03544703,-0.019618187,0.013112036,0.00034712916,0.014905493,-0.0008346873,0.016386485,0.00046120238,-0.014599973,-0.0042599877,-0.03138898,0.0086831665,0.0022986806,-0.0075777685,0.02790609,0.0075210724,0.0024588776,-0.006108222,0.0013952835,0.0039074435,-0.01751003,-0.010951686,0.024770401,-0.009911734,-0.014634153,-0.027171778,-0.02070943,0.007063863,-0.012219997,0.0010024753,-0.011930864,-0.011010951,0.019267308,0.0067622922,-0.03293672,-0.014409699,0.0073556635,-0.015411969,-0.024301678,-0.01612714,0.014583413,-0.13277136,-0.005173148,-0.018554782,9.8079