28	120	tt0120737	The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring	Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.	2001	179	8.4	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg	[-0.008338013,0.025283216,0.03300436,-0.05610655,-0.013038484,0.026540471,-0.024020554,0.012987298,0.040483493,-0.005857389,0.00058518606,-0.0019146373,-0.0045309155,0.003625864,0.121991724,-0.0212402,0.01871597,-0.013005754,0.02165396,-0.00027432945,-0.013734166,-0.0044690995,0.0051304693,-0.02653349,-0.013040538,-0.016260156,0.010804606,-0.018910186,0.017116856,-0.0005938806,0.028102068,0.0021184937,0.012574279,0.02959769,0.024614926,0.0008100737,-0.002580697,-0.027505813,-0.016536584,-0.018041646,-0.008835572,0.0058055865,0.02473162,-0.0048644776,-0.021809395,-0.02221392,0.022598822,0.029591693,0.0177474,0.0005582085,-0.019996598,0.016525758,0.0002242381,-0.19347292,-0.016442487,0.009110404,0.027397892,-0.012366017,0.0064026173,-0.002694504,-0.018163346,0.004573006,0.01955854,-0.0053301607,-0.02062857,-0.004658026,0.04022407,-0.024806553,-0.048673693,0.003325994,0.0066861156,-0.0044216043,-0.032908425,-0.02244887,-0.004425469,-0.016231071,-0.018460963,-0.015292702,0.03086975,0.028955597,0.023043387,0.009795083,-0.01951726,0.0011924452,-0.0022496656,0.024403274,-0.0048139235,-0.017010586,0.002651969,0.02647779,-0.008211206,0.0074856863,0.009405843,0.012396405,-0.026779618,0.0023618375,-0.008272962,-0.018027483,-0.02480193,0.01225077,-0.0138426395,-0.0034248158,0.02185333,0.0215877,-0.0074929097,0.011982296,0.0028962768,-0.009545419,-0.0063118674,0.029089846,0.0024838648,0.008357586,-0.031599518,-0.019359404,-0.005299458,-0.14377597,-0.011730205,-0.024724413,-0.010381223,-0.0101