130	290098	tt4016934	The Handmaiden	1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sook-hee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.	2016	145	8.2	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg	[-0.0075498107,-0.006221942,-0.007474189,-0.06833475,-0.0064204205,-0.018697226,-0.0048758667,-0.012559692,0.008960647,0.012775401,0.00057848624,0.008627155,-0.017314423,0.019194495,0.121731065,0.014237567,-0.0022344114,0.00021959044,0.0020194177,-0.01849589,-0.02706399,0.015619127,0.0036749959,-0.019993557,-0.012672014,-0.0062343776,0.0088888155,-0.002766301,0.03161124,0.0029811482,0.028816158,0.03249308,0.007381121,0.029897643,0.02791505,-0.023567026,-0.010596809,-0.007390424,0.008961014,-0.0016308011,0.011583208,0.016068786,-0.035353523,-0.01457165,-0.015221015,0.00081655046,-0.020972438,-0.0007443186,-0.0065626493,0.011219214,0.011024132,7.63249e-05,-0.02188765,-0.18804151,-0.020417573,0.02873411,0.011524532,-0.01684915,-0.00082433526,0.004013584,-0.013231236,0.01817598,0.0014389069,-0.054298468,-0.026231175,-0.008830104,-0.00492367,0.025341291,-0.014729978,0.025558319,-0.003932389,0.03738799,-0.015150014,0.006728602,0.010953788,0.006370245,-0.0065507614,0.00041791133,0.0020717555,-0.007641763,-0.015636448,-0.014093627,-0.027861902,-0.009968536,-0.0052647307,-0.012376678,-0.016100558,0.004978134,-0.00032091542,0.010093828,-0.018920515,0.010866174,0.013501399,0.025723187,-0.0073839426,0.0134941675,0.005611877,0.010174234,-0.017891413,0.0062147514,0.017135164,-0.0037024105,0.012562603,-0.014521106,0.0042153634,0.000733956,0.0068793744,0.00747407,-0.037110038,-0.0035514014,-0.00029469145,-0.0015631029,0.013099312,-0.012448765,-0.006785138,-0.15256502,-0.02341771,-0.012241444,-0.006605078,-0.0