129	284	tt0053604	The Apartment	Bud Baxter is a minor clerk in a huge New York insurance company, until he discovers a quick way to climb the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aftermath of their visits, one night he's left with a major problem to solve.	1960	126	8.2	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhSRt1KKfRT0yEhEtRW3qp31JFU.jpg	[-0.019243382,0.003595232,-0.005047932,-0.0662317,-0.01276266,-0.008167696,-0.0068293023,0.021879366,-0.0013900126,-0.0048397607,0.0040439824,-0.011488224,0.0002813555,-0.0044084727,0.13400358,-0.029329933,-0.011722937,0.007341004,0.017239511,-0.008067312,-0.0022849534,0.01114018,0.014565407,-0.0296915,-0.025432035,-0.011688115,0.025516737,-0.009958401,0.014122389,-0.011480436,-0.006697343,0.031513687,0.0015060238,0.01527525,0.030728552,-0.023384677,-0.013933691,-0.0020162137,0.0062777447,-0.0045312764,0.006606111,0.0081467405,-0.0025017853,-0.0034028648,-0.0016329222,0.005523834,-0.009822876,0.0178768,-0.0026924151,-0.007598156,-0.014582989,-0.013028833,0.0019385401,-0.16597764,-0.0032955264,-0.006271974,0.015730869,-0.006002513,0.0012490036,0.0072452906,-0.008456519,-0.026759513,0.005352204,-0.036630105,-0.020085158,-0.008376984,0.031298544,-0.032749288,-0.014595844,0.015395977,0.0037293143,-0.0011776687,-0.036821302,-0.0025776832,0.007927372,0.040329073,-0.008662808,-0.008727042,-0.003961281,-0.0044256756,0.014249944,0.0054375282,-0.013940778,0.0038739776,-0.01839948,0.013691012,0.0006176552,0.01447105,-0.023237998,0.0029338324,-0.031327218,0.008636893,0.029882556,0.0017259411,-0.0046980563,0.018299745,-0.009497809,0.001919677,-0.029575938,0.009069625,-0.00437836,0.012206239,0.020409811,-0.021320213,0.020363973,0.012301054,0.00090366206,-0.02398014,-0.013777824,0.014519212,0.012014355,-0.017751317,-0.02200136,0.013781192,0.00030520908,-0.1272033,0.012156121,-0.010453178,-0.0038581016,-0.016892867,-0.0014966016,-0.026611269,0.010827179,