52	274	tt0102926	The Silence of the Lambs	Clarice Starling is a top student at the FBI's training academy.  Jack Crawford wants Clarice to interview Dr. Hannibal Lecter, a brilliant psychiatrist who is also a violent psychopath, serving life behind bars for various acts of murder and cannibalism.  Crawford believes that Lecter may have insight into a case and that Starling, as an attractive young woman, may be just the bait to draw him out.	1991	119	8.3	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uS9m8OBk1A8eM9I042bx8XXpqAq.jpg	[-0.023645604,-0.016363515,0.008500992,-0.05509353,-0.008306796,0.0005510361,-0.014816333,0.010021158,0.020417022,0.027868332,-0.0056281285,-0.0059735295,-0.009358269,-0.0062107197,0.11131734,-0.008108224,-0.006305034,0.0034061081,0.025808308,-0.02421009,-0.013173857,-0.025788441,0.019056179,-0.0033142362,-0.0034441957,-0.008000056,0.010385249,-0.0028267,-0.002780762,0.009230752,-0.011977528,0.01604534,0.03247153,0.0277914,0.02502834,-0.020659115,-0.011553506,-0.011114636,0.005665485,-0.003603613,-0.00992804,0.047687188,-0.010050913,0.008731334,0.035248578,0.00297296,0.02218852,0.007876533,0.015667174,0.017176379,-0.020604225,0.019662986,-0.014473464,-0.17873578,-0.009479638,0.013539361,0.026707074,-0.023309281,0.012170062,-0.0022505124,-0.010751944,0.020669887,0.005107588,-0.03247065,-0.016147606,0.015033368,0.011501047,0.018364467,-0.017301114,-0.014146382,-0.020426374,-0.00153038,-0.019660315,0.0036117292,0.03430153,0.0076198387,0.014791856,0.0077459137,0.007798511,0.018027546,0.027159942,-0.007990007,-0.032030478,-0.0011309041,-0.011198958,0.014073733,0.023322877,0.0028888613,0.025419943,0.01198491,-0.02652962,0.012236055,0.04330889,-0.008475398,0.0032503423,-0.001222861,0.01612893,-0.022127807,-0.0020360418,0.015549468,-0.02242705,0.012072532,-0.008339266,-0.0044354736,0.006843954,0.0025411216,0.010137582,0.015337432,-0.020132637,0.000985985,-0.008299987,0.012054314,-0.04384324,0.025721528,-0.00018494618,-0.1538655,0.023855964,-0.0061521716,0.007240