29	14537	tt0056058	Harakiri	Down-on-his-luck veteran Tsugumo Hanshir┼ì enters the courtyard of the prosperous House of Iyi. Unemployed, and with no family, he hopes to find a place to commit seppukuΓÇöand a worthy second to deliver the coup de gr├óce in his suicide ritual. The senior counselor for the Iyi clan questions the roninΓÇÖs resolve and integrity, suspecting Hanshir┼ì of seeking charity rather than an honorable end. What follows is a pair of interlocking stories which lay bare the difference between honor and respect, and promises to examine the legendary foundations of the Samurai code.	1962	135	8.4	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nPwMd3KviJWaHzG9fZCqlwWMas.jpg	[-0.00714119,-0.01802335,0.01534317,-0.07001308,-0.009117651,0.013453713,0.0035182384,-0.0022805594,0.01675656,0.01866711,0.002590768,0.0030413726,0.0031210415,0.009562192,0.12509605,0.013646473,0.0027063654,0.020038854,-0.007716659,-0.0052321986,0.020462997,-0.02151869,-0.01411963,-0.027493669,0.0005941696,-0.01974277,-0.007338162,-0.005713843,0.022558449,0.007477089,-0.029272037,0.023491884,-0.0068755965,0.038855333,0.015511918,-0.031872187,-0.008751592,-0.012723787,0.0059875627,-0.0021163244,0.009971659,0.023449209,0.020704372,0.0054076836,-0.0117626125,-0.0033893592,0.0005664838,-0.014546665,0.021516766,0.026049178,-0.016192937,-0.007403508,0.007727131,-0.16927618,3.3886718e-05,0.010920868,0.017847922,0.009465607,-0.022383487,-0.01681067,-0.016107878,-0.018202428,0.006960328,-0.041414198,-0.011817424,0.0019078883,0.026607828,0.010810899,-0.03484843,0.014580952,0.000101586935,0.012657875,-0.0018014613,-0.0149108805,0.023572218,0.0028519437,-0.0021852057,-0.0031485385,0.008809705,-0.008458108,0.0028386419,-0.0074147633,-0.015274966,-0.031780116,0.0075410185,-0.0024908294,0.0012311686,0.005943758,-0.0116492575,0.012238719,0.005527341,0.0040073465,-0.010902856,0.014088232,0.0105214985,0.028283972,0.028188337,-0.01981789,-0.03854377,-0.0028962686,-0.020117903,-0.022036899,0.014202211,-0.024065785,0.