234	359940	tt5027774	Three Billboards Outside Ebbing, Missouri	After seven months have passed without a culprit in her daughter's murder case, Mildred Hayes makes a bold move, painting three signs leading into her town with a controversial message directed at Bill Willoughby, the town's revered chief of police. When his second-in-command Officer Jason Dixon, an immature mother's boy with a penchant for violence, gets involved, the battle between Mildred and Ebbing's law enforcement is only exacerbated.	2017	115	8.1	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRYLt8fV82tdVoDppSFTZIcJiLN.jpg	[-0.012658492,0.011073283,-0.0021201132,-0.034166746,-0.01408175,0.002046935,0.0005052224,0.006836296,0.01985784,0.017535772,-0.013679752,-0.0025355802,-0.017169034,0.014082157,0.11241389,0.012358655,0.012422583,0.003065385,0.009436367,0.009606138,-0.0106655555,-0.023754839,0.027259408,0.008283763,0.0015540909,-0.009783905,-0.0046497327,0.024364764,0.0065055727,-0.009485001,-0.008427818,0.021996008,0.0041188626,0.012694398,-0.007020497,-0.019676002,0.007983469,-0.015781192,0.003054224,0.005484056,0.007430026,0.022179222,-0.0051211845,-0.0102022085,-0.0048287786,0.0045537674,0.00029276384,-0.008224405,-0.002692814,-0.0076014185,-0.01396105,-0.0084942635,-0.0010726196,-0.18362637,-0.018791527,0.0038582168,0.017867148,0.023941582,0.020947209,-0.01911666,0.00051681267,-0.0005757785,-0.00060849584,-0.064909,-0.023508603,-0.003209834,0.013056208,0.0042571225,-0.024057033,-0.0023942403,-0.017863855,0.029444434,-0.03269437,-0.010606148,0.00034987516,0.01115316,0.036602836,-0.018131828,-0.008753723,0.012781096,-0.0011272538,-0.007093057,-0.025339428,0.0054348283,-0.024221437,-0.0070536234,-0.0240436,0.008772265,0.014097736,0.014639875,-0.007930576,0.022455035,0.040736772,0.020993896,-0.0077532562,-0.03879073,-0.010399985,-0.017354652,0.005642261,0.0018755777,0.0034697982,-0.011021991,-0.0013307619,0.008952588,-0.013291196,0.028453823,-0.0029577543,0.008327678,-0.019067172,0.014491275,0.007576199,0.000