87	29259	tt0054407	Le Trou	Four prison inmates have been hatching a plan to literally dig out of jail when another prisoner, Claude Gaspard, is moved into their cell. They take a risk and share their plan with the newcomer. Over the course of three days, the prisoners and friends break through the concrete floor using a bed post and begin to make their way through the sewer system ΓÇô yet their escape is anything but assured.	1960	132	8.3	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyZhiOz5NHVBUKlpioxjwajy7pm.jpg	[-0.007628202,-0.022204915,-0.0053530433,-0.079852715,-0.015809258,0.008596668,-0.019037593,0.004502552,0.010285946,-0.024335112,-0.017732047,-0.0015628313,0.01732143,0.005316641,0.16517036,-0.017596377,-0.011956018,0.010981536,0.007191079,0.0022480527,-0.009312514,0.00028879198,0.023423351,-0.017626574,-0.017411374,-0.0072262892,0.0011170619,0.025920782,0.010125545,-0.0035247228,-0.002634873,0.023828045,0.0068172445,0.024072764,-0.005494025,-0.04376277,-0.011979433,-0.0043249493,-0.003577996,-0.00067479647,0.011085876,0.009861381,0.019527916,0.023992468,-0.014538471,-0.00044259377,0.0034871378,-0.0005005914,0.0050119273,0.025019787,-0.013052393,-0.014294616,-0.026069371,-0.18029511,-0.026378384,-0.00038529126,0.01872798,-0.016925884,-0.0007085934,0.0077709234,-0.0075983354,-0.010172157,0.043735452,-0.020117432,-0.018809736,-0.003052318,0.00061437406,0.011553157,-0.0348603,-0.0023980308,-0.017709026,0.042535704,-0.02412478,0.0034402537,0.0011660882,0.006871485,-0.00081857375,-0.009195845,0.023243653,0.0032195156,0.026769284,-0.012131519,0.0067703677,-0.0045464723,-0.007289497,-0.014831942,0.02008927,-0.00271219,-0.002644311,0.015347345,0.0022364932,0.006965423,0.00139932,-0.0005860706,0.0051952093,0.008736927,0.013239685,0.009068344,-0.0044950712,-0.010977228,-0.03962858,0.0042531155,-0.0083074365,-0.010832369,0.016887806,0.012872951,0.011414698,0.0132806385,-0.020429872,-0.002249547,0.00962885,0.010946955,0.00037199364,0.0035637352,0.029817833,-0.13956888,-0.010575739