156	3780	tt0058888	Red Beard	Aspiring to an easy job as personal physician to a wealthy family, Noboru Yasumoto is disappointed when his first post after medical school takes him to a small country clinic under the gruff doctor Red Beard. Yasumoto rebels in numerous ways, but Red Beard proves a wise and patient teacher. He gradually introduces his student to the unglamorous side of the profession, ultimately assigning him to care for a prostitute rescued from a local brothel.	1965	185	8.1	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYNH3Re0JSypoYaWvZtERUnNaJL.jpg	[0.005969321,-0.005506543,-0.0023032392,-0.081932314,0.004774542,0.0088458825,-0.02173777,0.014603448,0.043010056,0.012745891,0.0075956224,0.014182256,0.005799889,0.024195772,0.123391956,-0.00356044,-0.003928199,0.016017376,0.013441181,-0.012871075,0.019601824,-0.009990802,-0.0036719462,-0.04405393,-0.018283645,-0.014675016,0.012595523,0.026601013,0.016338749,-0.016759474,0.00031109943,0.020446073,0.017710077,0.010560549,0.016414512,-0.006751437,-0.004623254,0.01783448,0.015357003,0.0011054525,-0.0057993694,0.017437669,0.008348009,-0.01564065,-0.018861685,0.0032214106,0.0034917982,-0.032648854,0.0031327195,0.0087785125,-0.032219138,-0.013288018,-0.008062321,-0.18289521,-0.0069498625,0.008527666,0.019699786,-0.0070985886,-0.0050719427,-0.0016588196,-0.02460533,-0.0169746,0.02754849,-0.019433534,-0.0098478785,0.004793758,0.02437133,-0.009325965,-0.0049851714,-0.00078041037,-0.010146187,0.0015949657,-0.018551774,0.009189561,0.02401753,0.016261589,-0.017168175,0.005020049,0.0068731443,-0.0032802983,0.009059352,0.001598753,-0.0065132803,-0.014662028,-0.021907315,0.0048103165,0.012354942,0.016892558,0.0069806734,0.023282912,-0.020189038,-0.0039282627,0.0050255614,-0.014115285,0.010184083,0.005197677,0.006974571,-0.0330984,-0.015278402,0.0018004677,0.0010162484,0.010205387,-0.0066709025,-0.0013789679,0.014850577,0.0008537612,0.0073116906,0.0032612942,-0.029932223,-0.0045327395,0.039222933,-0.014678105,-0.02723368,0.013764312,